re reservoir of human failure.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605430/extras/4671c27d7578b1bb62dc0dc173cd0e03.poster.avif?t=1743433494\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2605430/extras/4671c27d7578b1bb62dc0dc173cd0e03.webm?t=1743433494\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>For fans of experimental escape room stories<br></li><li>you are here for peace no gun can stop this guy. Although the ending is quite shocking<br></li><li>An unpredicted Ai that can be anywhere near his collection and surprises you!</li></ul>",
